# skills.versions

# This file pins the versions of specific skills used in this project.
# It ensures that all developers and agents use the same version of a skill.
# To verify a skill's version, use the `skills.sh info <skill>` command.
#
# Format: <source>/<skill-name>@<version>
#
# Example:
#
# anthropic/review-pr@1.2.0
# cursor-dev/generate-tests@2.0.1
